type: software
title: "spm: Scope Performance Metrics for Flutter rebuild scopes"
abstract: >-
  Unified static analysis and runtime profiling for Flutter rebuild scopes and
  their triggers. Version 0.8.0 adds `spm screen`, which gives a direction
  verdict for the rebuild cost of each changed scope, never a build time.
